@Pieter Kasselman, in the three-pillar picture, where does the organization behind a trust domain fit, for parties with no prior relationship?

Francesco, I think your question is about what I think of as "Trust Frameworks", which is not about the mechanics for setting up trust relationships, but rather the rules, regulations and contractual relationships. This tend to vary based on deployment models, vertical industries and jurisdictions and is typically handled outside of technical standards. 
Within techncial standards there are different mechansims for sharing trust anchors etc, but I view that as something seperate from the "Trust Framework", which is beyond technicals standards.
